{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTime\/halign","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The most typical case is for credits, such as:"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltime\/halign"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"halign","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLeftCenterRight","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Words and music by Pat Songwriter","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Typically this type of credit is aligned to the right, so that the position information refers to the right-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"most part of the text. But in this example, the text is center-justified, not right-justified.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The halign attribute is used in these situations. If it is not present, its value is the same as for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"justify attribute. For elements where a justify attribute is not allowed, the default is implementation-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dependent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"code":"halign","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}],"type":"par